WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:03,530
Are you sure there's nothing wrong with the people you brought?

2
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:07,780
Do you want me to put my head here as a guarantee?

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:11,950
No need, no need

4
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:16,800
Don't worry, brother Zhao

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,800
I guarantee it on the honor of the Tie family

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,800
Let this brother reach the imperial capital safely

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:30,840
That's good sir

8
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,840
You can just stay in this inn from now on

9
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:35,220
The shopkeeper will arrange it for you

10
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,220
Thank you

11
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,290
Wei Tongling saved my life on the battlefield.

12
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:40,290
If you are his friend, you are my friend

13
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,290
You're welcome

14
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:46,460
Guests can stay in the store first

15
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,460
You can leave tomorrow

16
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,460
Why don't you go clean up this young man's room quickly?
